  "details": "<p><em>The Barrington Atlas Directory</em> notes: Corcolle. This instance of a place called Pedum should not be confused with another <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"../438803\" target=\"_self\" title=\"Barrington Atlas: BAtlas 44 Pedum\">Pedum</a> that is thought to correspond to modern Gallicano nel Lazio.</p>",
